{"product":{"id":8072665825358,"title":"Zimaya Tiramisu Discovery Set","body_html":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThis set brings together three indulgent creations from Zimaya’s Tiramisu collection — a creamy chocolate gourmand, a rich caramel-vanilla blend, and a coffee-infused dessert scent. Three miniatures that showcase the deliciously sweet character of the collection before going full bottle.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eInside:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e• \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTiramisu S’mores\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is marshmallow, chocolate, coffee, nectarine blossom, and bergamot over vanilla, biscuit, almond, milk, and musk, settling into caramel, sugar, creamy notes, and amber — rich, creamy, and irresistibly gourmand.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e• \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTiramisu Caramel\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is caramel over woody notes, coumarin, and honey, settling into vanilla, whiskey, and musk — warm, smooth, and decadently sweet.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e• \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTiramisu Coco\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is amaretto and coffee over ice cream, vanilla, and biscuit, settling into brown sugar, vanilla, and amber — creamy, boozy, and deliciously comforting.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThree Tiramisu indulgences, one irresistible set — the perfect way to discover your favorite Zimaya gourmand.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Scentira","product_type":"Bundle","created_at":"2026-09-15T15:16:13+05:30","handle":"zimaya-tiramis